title Home Assistant: Offline: the server went away, three tries failed (time running 20 times faster); the last values greyed, the time of the last update
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO offline

wait 3500
shot offline
check offline
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect noquit
